{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06523","headline":"游茅山五首 三 · 储光羲","name":"游茅山五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生非作者，望古怀清芬。\n心以道爲际，行将时不羣。\n兹山在人境，灵贶久传闻。\n远势一峰出，近形千嶂分。\n冬春有茂草，朝暮多鲜云。\n此去亦何极，但言西日曛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}